This is a placeholder APK file. The actual APK will be generated when you run the GitHub Actions workflow.

To generate the real APK:
1. Go to: https://github.com/EwenChepelov/Camembert/actions/workflows/build-and-release.yml
2. Click "Run workflow"
3. Wait for completion
4. Download from Releases: https://github.com/EwenChepelov/Camembert/releases

This file is here to ensure the directory structure exists for the workflow.